{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_021_02_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d61d3fb0692ab832aec3ae287d9ba3fc642563d473e6eae9c3c7426d3d93e702",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_c:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:827d6f4c962e5e30c3719a2ae6e2162e384e98e552c699c55d5a2de3f5660aba",
      "text": "旬先生在帮隼人先生筹备生日派对的时候，\n是什么心情呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_c:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c48b10a44d970cdc16c622e95f60249dc61bece7779409eea480d354ea55e2fc",
      "text": "我当时只觉得……明明隼人自己都已经察觉到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5999cb5a1c7d785b3ba7180af8719ccafa90fcfea85e3e2c49e89ed355afa806",
      "text": "虽然是这样，但当时不开心吗？\n那个时候的旬先生，看起来也很开心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:874ef2aeed14a69ccbc177b60f8658e7aa558be131bedd0b12ef25c43417fdb3",
      "text": "……看到他高兴，感觉倒也不坏。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c40179b1ea5ac7eea45f8228a6617b6aee7153df051fc243af5023ab34067c49",
      "text": "我想大家肯定也是带着同样的心情\n在行动的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7f878b8ced1a7957c560d573e30ddbbc1696e38c370513aacbbf4bff12e7f43",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_c:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03fa57ad3423d5edb3344e28c062e79afe9f658f5c8fdb35c59118a05f8c45e7",
      "text": "差点忘了！\n我有事想拜托制作人酱！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74e0c265cc14acba27b616d01e5debe7007b26419b1b77c398e82c00bb2fdf1c",
      "text": "旬亲的生日派对，\n制作人酱也一定要来参加哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_c:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a2b4b616585937e75f4a4e49c4c7280a75aabe2439cd5571fff4dafa9f5b84c",
      "text": "一定要来哦！好啦，\n旬亲！拜拜咻☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_c:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4beae26be025670e546b7f2e7c5270360d7321fcf12e5dc449fdd4b883382e01",
      "text": "他还是一如既往地毛毛躁躁呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_021jun_02_1_2_021_02:1_2_021_02_c:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4326dfd11e09eacb20ade3143ae5efde0874707931c4684e2f8a35c28a08f81e",
      "text": "哈哈……\n生日派对，真让人期待呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
